hadiths[14]{hadithnumber,text}:
"547","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aur Aap ne do rakatein padhein. (Bukhari: 1012)"
"548","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki mominon mein se kamzoron key liye aur Muzar par (baddua ki) dua ki hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat key aakhir mein farmaya: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghifaar ko Allah maaf karey aur Aslam ko Allah salaamat rakkhey. (Bukhari: 1006)"
"549","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab logon se roogardaani dekhi to farmaya: Ae Allah! Yusuf key saat (saalon) jaisa saat (saal). To unhey qehat ne pakad liya jis ne har cheez ko moond diya. Yahan tak ke wo khaalein aur murdaar aur gandagi khaatey they. Aur un mein se koi aasmaan ki taraf dekhta to bhook se dhuwan dekhta. To Aap key paas Abu Sufyan aaya aur us ne kaha: Ae Muhammad! Beshak tum Allah ki itaat aur sila rehmi ka hukm detey ho. Aur beshak tumhaari qaum halaak ho gai hai, to Allah se unkey liye dua karo. Allah Taala ne farmaya: (To us din ka intezaar karo jab aasmaan waazeh dhuwan laaeyga) uskey qaul (beshak tum lautney waley ho, jis din ham badi pakad pakdengey, beshak ham badla lenay waley hain) tak. To pakad Badr key din hai. Aur dhuwan aur pakad aur laazim aur Room ki nishaani guzar chuki hain. (Bukhari: 1007)"
"550","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Baaz auqaat main shair ka qaul yaad karta tha jabke main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key chehrey ki taraf dekh raha hota, Aap baarish maang rahey hotey. To Aap na utartey yahan tak ke har parnaala behney lagta. Aur wo Abu Taalib ka qaul hai: Aur gora jiskey chehrey se baadal se paani maanga jaata hai, yateemon ka sahaara bewaon ki panaah. (Bukhari: 1009)"
"551","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo jab qehat mein hotey to Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib (Raziallahu anhu) key sath baarish maangtey. To farmatey: Ae Allah! Beshak ham terey Nabi key sath terey paas waseela pakadtey they aur tu hamein pilaata tha. Aur beshak ham terey Nabi key chacha key sath terey paas waseela pakadtey hain, to hamein pila. Unhon-ne kaha: To unhey pilaaya jaata. (Bukhari: 1010)"
"552","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Umar Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apney haath uthaaey aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Hamein baarish dey! Ae Allah! Hamein baarish dey! Ae Allah! Hamein baarish dey! (Bukhari: 1014)"
"553","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Umar Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apney haath uthaaey aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Hamein baarish dey! Ae Allah! Hamein baarish dey! Ae Allah! Hamein baarish dey! (Bukhari: 1014)"
"554","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ki istisqaa mein hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein farmaya: To Aap ne logon ki taraf apni peeth ki aur qibley ki taraf munh kya aur dua ki. Phir apni chaadar palti. Phir hamein do rakatein padhaaein jin mein qiraat buland aawaaz se ki. (Bukhari: 1024)"
"555","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni kisi dua mein haath na uthaatey they magar istisqaa mein. Aur beshak Aap uthaatey yahan tak ke Aapki baghalon ki safedi dekhi jaati. (Bukhari: 1031)"
"556","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab baarish dekhtey to farmatey: Ae Allah! Faeda mand barsaane wali (baarish bana). (Bukhari: 1032)"
"557","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Jab tez hawa chalti to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key chehrey mein pehchaana jaata. (Bukhari: 1034)"
"558","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri Saba (mashriqi hawa) key sath madad ki gai aur Aad Daboor (maghribi hawa) se halaak kiye gaey. (Bukhari: 1035)"
"559","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Hamein hamaarey Shaam mein aur hamaarey Yaman mein barkat dey. Unhon-ne kaha: Unhon-ne kaha: Aur hamaarey Najd mein. Unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Hamein hamaarey Shaam mein aur hamaarey Yaman mein barkat dey. Unhon-ne kaha: Unhon-ne kaha: Aur hamaarey Najd mein. Unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne farmaya: Wahaan zalzaley aur fitney hain aur us se shaitaan ka seeng nikalta hai. (Bukhari: 1037)"
"560","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghaib ki kunji paanch hain, unhey Allah key siwa koi nahi jaanta: Koi nahi jaanta ke kal kya hoga. Aur koi nahi jaanta ke rehamon mein kya hai. Aur koi jaan nahi jaanti ke wo kal kya kamaayegi. Aur koi jaan nahi jaanti ke wo kis zameen mein maregi. Aur koi nahi jaanta ke baarish kab aaeygi. (Bukhari: 1039). Kitaab-ul-Kusoof."
